This product bundles Ansible roles in rodeo/data/ansible/ and uses the
following open-source components at runtime:

- ansible-core (GPL-3.0) — https://github.com/ansible/ansible
- community.libvirt Ansible collection (GPL-3.0) — https://github.com/ansible-collections/community.libvirt
- libvirt-python (LGPL-2.1) — https://gitlab.com/libvirt/libvirt-python
- click (BSD-3-Clause) — https://github.com/pallets/click
- rich (MIT) — https://github.com/Textualize/rich
- textual (MIT) — https://github.com/Textualize/textual
- PyYAML (MIT) — https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml
- Jinja2 (BSD-3-Clause) — https://github.com/pallets/jinja
- lxml (BSD-3-Clause) — https://github.com/lxml/lxml

Runtime dependencies are installed separately and are not distributed
as part of this package. Their licenses apply independently.
